error[MR0204]: `&` is not defined for `double` and `double`
 --> tests/ui/types/operators.mr:3:13
  |
3 |     let a = x & x; //~ ERROR MR0204
  |             -^^^-
  |             |   |
  |             |   this is `double`
  |             this is `double`
  |
  = note: `&` is defined only on integer types

