error[MR0203]: mismatched types: expected `int`, found `long`
  --> tests/ui/types/operators.mr:20:25
   |
20 |     let ok5: int = n << 1L; //~ ERROR MR0203
   |                         ^^ this is `long`
   |
   = note: `long` converts to `int` only through an explicit cast, because not every value of `long` is a value of `int`
help: convert it explicitly with `(int)`
   |
20 |     let ok5: int = n << (int)1L; //~ ERROR MR0203
   |                         +++++

