35 |     let a = Console.ReadLine() && n; //~ ERROR MR0204
   |                                   ^ this is `int`
   |
   = note: `&&` and `||` combine `bool` values; compare a number explicitly, as in `x != 0`
help: compare it with zero
   |
35 |     let a = Console.ReadLine() && n != 0; //~ ERROR MR0204
   |                                     ++++

